// Solid, hot rock -- SLIME09-12 in this mod's own floor table (see
// fancy_tables.zs) are already treated as "hot surface, not a pool" for
// the same reason: they read as scorched stone, not something you wade
// into. A splash without the liquid flag, so footsteps still land solid.
terrain MTOLavaSolid
{
	splash MTOLava
}

